// Committed. Defaults to Xcode's automatic local (ad-hoc) signing, which
// re-prompts for Keychain access on every rebuild because the ad-hoc identity
// changes each build.
//
// To stop the prompt: create a stable self-signed code-signing certificate
// (see Local.xcconfig.example / scripts/create-signing-cert.sh) and put its
// name in Local.xcconfig. That file is gitignored, so this override stays
// local — without it the optional include below is a no-op and the build is
// unchanged for everyone else.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
